    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>state-prev-day-rainfall · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-gather-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-gather-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">const INDEX_COUNT: u32 = 12u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">const WORDS_PER_ROW: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">const OUTPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"4\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputWords: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"6\">const SOURCE_LENGTH: u32 = 1024u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const SOURCE_ROW_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"8\">const SOURCE_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const INDEX_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; sourceWords: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"11\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; indices: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"13\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"14\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3u,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * 1u + workgroupId.y) * 1u + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  if (index &gt;= INDEX_COUNT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  let outputBase = OUTPUT_OFFSET + index * WORDS_PER_ROW;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  let sourceIndex = indices[INDEX_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  if (sourceIndex &gt;= SOURCE_ROW_OFFSET &amp;&amp; sourceIndex - SOURCE_ROW_OFFSET &lt; SOURCE_LENGTH) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">    let sourceBase = SOURCE_OFFSET + (sourceIndex - SOURCE_ROW_OFFSET) * 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">    for (var word = 0u; word &lt; WORDS_PER_ROW; word++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">      outputWords[outputBase + word] = sourceWords[sourceBase + word];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  for (var word = 0u; word &lt; WORDS_PER_ROW; word++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    outputWords[outputBase + word] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>outputWords<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"statePrevDayRainfall\">statePrevDayRainfall</td><td>write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>sourceWords<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"prevDayRainfall\">prevDayRainfall</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>indices<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"stateStations\">stateStations</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUGather/copy-rows · main · 361181bb</figcaption></figure></section>",
